 <COL N="0135B"></COL> toún pavpan.</FOREIGN>  Mox:  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Toú deú kataú Bigivlion, povshn ouj prosepimartureið
ajprosexivan twðé eujsebeið cartofuvlakiv sou_ Eij
