ajpokrivnasqai. Eij gavr tiû toiðû par1 uJmwðn grafeiðsi sunenevsei,</FOREIGN> (sic)  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oujdeún eåteron parainevsei toiðû 1Aiguptivoiû, hÞ
Qeovdwrou kaiú Nestovrion touúû aiJretikouúû devxasqai, kaiú
 <COL N="0327A"></COL> pavntaû touúû aJgivouû patevraû katadikavsai, touúû katakrivnantaû
ejkeivnouû te kaiú thún aujtwðn ajpistivan, kaiú proúû
