ejgravyate ajpokrivnasqai toiðû ejnantivoiû thðû ajkklhsivaû,
kalhún kaiú ojrqovdoxon eiønai thún musaraún ejkeivnhn ejpistolhvn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0327"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Spoudavsate toivnun prwðton meún uJmaðû aujtouúû diorqwvsasqai,
kaiú ouåtwû aællouû didavxai. Eiæ tiû gaúr hÞ Qeovdwron,
hÞ thún legomevnhn 3Iba ejpistolhún, hÞ taú Qeodwrivtou
suggravmmata taú kataú thðû ojrqhðû pivstewû ejkteqevnta ejkdikeið,
